      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Seedance task query\n\nA Seedance task keeps running on BytePlus after you close ComfyUI, and its result stays for 24 hours. Paste a **task ID** and this node collects it: how many tasks matched, their status and the model that made them.\n\nWhere to find a task ID: the *Task ID* line in the ComfyUI console while a video runs, the *draft_task_id* output of a Seedance 2.5 Draft node, or leave the ID empty to list your latest tasks (filter with *status* and *model_version*).\n\nNeeds a ModelArk key in Settings > BytePlus."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
